    "<br/>\n",
    "\n",
    "By default, lokigi will\n",
    "\n",
    "- brute force the solution\n",
    "- assume you want to solve a p-median problem (minimize travel time - weighted by demand if you provide that)\n",
    "  - but it also supports p-center (minimizing max travel time) and the Maximal Covering Location Problem (optimizing for being within x distance)\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "And you can then immediately see a range of metrics for all possible solutions."
